    "query": "Quranic verb forms",
    "source": "gold-standard",
    "notes": "Topic mode — 10 cards covering the awzān system. Forms IX (colours/defects, rare in Quran) omitted. Ultra-terse: front = form label + phonological marker; back = semantic function + one Quranic example."
