        "decision"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "front": "Framing effect",
      "back": "Identical information presented differently changes decisions: '90% survival' vs '10% mortality'",
      "tags": [
        "decision"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "front": "In-group bias",
      "back": "Favouring members of one's own group over out-group in evaluations and resource allocation",
